g?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":384},"pageimage":"Motoshirane_Daisan_Ground.png","extract":"本白根第3グランド（もとしらねだいさんぐらんど）は、群馬県草津町にある球技場である。1987年完成。"},"141558":{"pageid":141558,"ns":0,"title":"万座温泉","index":3,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.63717,"lon":138.51008,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Manza_Onsen_Tsumagoi_Gunma01bs4272.jpg/500px-Manza_Onsen_Tsumagoi_Gunma01bs4272.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"Manza_Onsen_Tsumagoi_Gunma01bs4272.jpg","extract":"万座温泉（まんざおんせん）は、群馬県吾妻郡嬬恋村干俣（ほしまた）（旧国上野国）にある上信越高原国立公園内、標高1,800mに位置する温泉。岐阜県下呂市の濁河温泉と並び通年自家用車で辿り着ける日本最高所の温泉である。"},"142152":{"pageid":142152,"ns":0,"title":"尻焼温泉","index":4,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.648111,"lon":138.641389,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8a/Shiriyaki_Onsen_04.jpg/500px-Shiriyaki_Onsen_04.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"Shiriyaki_Onsen_04.jpg","extract":"尻焼温泉（しりやきおんせん）は、群馬県吾妻郡中之条町大字入山（旧国上野国）にある温泉。"},"173556":{"pageid":173556,"ns":0,"title":"長野原草津口駅","index":5,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.54653889,"lon":138.64932778,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/JR_Agatsuma_Line_Naganoharakusatsuguchi_Station_building.jpg/500px-JR_Agatsuma_Line_Naganoharakusatsuguchi_Station_building.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":251},"pageimage":"JR_Agatsuma_Line_Naganoharakusatsuguchi_Station_building.jpg","extract":"長野原草津口駅（ながのはらくさつぐちえき）は、群馬県吾妻郡長野原町大字長野原にある、東日本旅客鉄道（JR東日本）吾妻線の駅。"},"195486":{"pageid":195486,"ns":0,"title":"花敷温泉","index":6,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.64758,"lon":138.64783,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Japan_Joshinetsu_topographic_map.webp/500px-Japan_Joshinetsu_topographic_map.webp?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":480},"pageimage":"Japan_Joshinetsu_topographic_map.webp","extract":"花敷温泉（はなしきおんせん）は、群馬県吾妻郡中之条町（旧国上野国）にある温泉。尻焼温泉、応徳温泉、京塚温泉と共に六合温泉郷を形成する。"},"197688":{"pageid":197688,"ns":0,"title":"群馬大津駅","index":7,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.55381111,"lon":138.62797222,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/JR_Agatsuma_Line_Gumma-Otsu_Station_Overall.jpg/500px-JR_Agatsuma_Line_Gumma-Otsu_Station_Overall.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":258},"pageimage":"JR_Agatsuma_Line_Gumma-Otsu_Station_Overall.jpg","extract":"群馬大津駅（ぐんまおおつえき）は、群馬県吾妻郡長野原町大字長野原にある、東日本旅客鉄道（JR東日本）吾妻線の駅である。"},"197691":{"pageid":197691,"ns":0,"title":"羽根尾駅","index":8,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.55009444,"lon":138.60543611,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/JR_Agatsuma_Line_Haneo_Station_Appearance.jpg/500px-JR_Agatsuma_Line_Haneo_Station_Appearance.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":261},"pageimage":"JR_Agatsuma_Line_Haneo_Station_Appearance.jpg","extract":"羽根尾駅（はねおえき）は、群馬県吾妻郡長野原町大字羽根尾にある、東日本旅客鉄道（JR東日本）吾妻線の駅である。"},"197693":{"pageid":197693,"ns":0,"title":"袋倉駅","index":9,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.54408889,"lon":138.5789,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c0/JR_Agatsuma_Line_Fukurogura_Station_Overall.jpg/500px-JR_Agatsuma_Line_Fukurogura_Station_Overall.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":255},"pageimage":"JR_Agatsuma_Line_Fukurogura_Station_Overall.jpg","extract":"袋倉駅（ふくろぐらえき）は、群馬県吾妻郡嬬恋村大字袋倉にある、東日本旅客鉄道（JR東日本）吾妻線の駅である。"},"286725":{"pageid":286725,"ns":0,"title":"長野原町","index":10,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.54439,"lon":138.64978,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/82/1015yukake.JPG/500px-1015yukake.JPG?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"1015yukake.JPG","extract":"長野原町（ながのはらまち）は、群馬県の北西部、吾妻郡西部にある町。町内の北軽井沢の一部地域は上信越高原国立公園に含まれる。"},"322606":{"pageid":322606,"ns":0,"title":"草津白根山","index":11,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.6453,"lon":138.5283,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Kusatsu-Shiranesan03s5s4272.jpg/500px-Kusatsu-Shiranesan03s5s4272.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"Kusatsu-Shiranesan03s5s4272.jpg","extract":"草津白根山（くさつ しらねさん）は、日本の北関東、群馬県吾妻郡草津町に所在する山。複数の火砕丘からなる複合火砕丘である。"},"396651":{"pageid":396651,"ns":0,"title":"群馬県立長野原高等学校","index":12,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.54666667,"lon":138.63111111,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Naganoharahighschool.JPG/500px-Naganoharahighschool.JPG?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"Naganoharahighschool.JPG","extract":"群馬県立長野原高等学校（ぐんまけんりつながのはらこうとうがっこう）は群馬県吾妻郡長野原町にある県立高校である。通称“長高（ながこう）”。"},"435134":{"pageid":435134,"ns":0,"title":"白根開善学校中等部・高等部","index":13,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.66394444,"lon":138.61230556,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Shirane_Kaizen_School-1.jpg/500px-Shirane_Kaizen_School-1.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":300},"pageimage":"Shirane_Kaizen_School-1.jpg","extract":"白根開善学校中等部・高等部（しらねかいぜんがっこうちゅうとうぶ・こうとうぶ）は、群馬県吾妻郡中之条町に所在する私立中学校・高等学校。運営は学校法人白根開善学校。"},"441594":{"pageid":441594,"ns":0,"title":"長野原警察署","index":14,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.55444444,"lon":138.62363889,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"extract":"長野原警察署（ながのはらけいさつしょ）は、群馬県警察が管轄する警察署の一つである。"},"452566":{"pageid":452566,"ns":0,"title":"道の駅六合","index":15,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.60747,"lon":138.63864,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Michinoeki_kuni.jpg/500px-Michinoeki_kuni.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"Michinoeki_kuni.jpg","extract":"道の駅六合（みちのえき くに）は、群馬県吾妻郡中之条町にある国道292号の道の駅である。"},"452796":{"pageid":452796,"ns":0,"title":"道の駅草津運動茶屋公園","index":16,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.61453,"lon":138.59006,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Michinoeki_kusatsu_undojaya_park.jpg/500px-Michinoeki_kusatsu_undojaya_park.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"Michinoeki_kusatsu_undojaya_park.jpg","extract":"道の駅草津運動茶屋公園（みちのえき くさつうんどうじゃやこうえん）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町にある国道292号の道の駅である。標高は1,231mで道の駅の中では「道の駅美ヶ原高原」に次いで2番目の標高の高さにある。"},"554104":{"pageid":554104,"ns":0,"title":"渋峠","index":17,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.66625,"lon":138.534528,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Shibu-toge01n3200.jpg/500px-Shibu-toge01n3200.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"Shibu-toge01n3200.jpg","extract":"渋峠（しぶとうげ）は、群馬県吾妻郡中之条町と長野県下高井郡山ノ内町の間にある峠である。"},"673906":{"pageid":673906,"ns":0,"title":"ジェイアールバス関東長野原支店","index":18,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.5518401,"lon":138.6368556,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/JR-Bus-Kanto-Naganohara-Branch.JPG/500px-JR-Bus-Kanto-Naganohara-Branch.JPG?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"JR-Bus-Kanto-Naganohara-Branch.JPG","extract":"ジェイアールバス関東長野原支店（ジェイアールバスかんとうながのはらしてん）は、群馬県吾妻郡長野原町にあるジェイアールバス関東の営業所。"},"675663":{"pageid":675663,"ns":0,"title":"上信越高原国立公園","index":19,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.625,"lon":138.625,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Kusatsu-Shiranesan03s5s4272.jpg/500px-Kusatsu-Shiranesan03s5s4272.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"Kusatsu-Shiranesan03s5s4272.jpg","extract":"上信越高原国立公園（じょうしんえつこうげんこくりつこうえん）は、日本国の群馬県（上野国）、長野県（信濃国）及び新潟県（越後国）の3県の境界にまたがる国立公園である。上信越国立公園とも言う。"},"804914":{"pageid":804914,"ns":0,"title":"国立療養所栗生楽泉園","index":20,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.61805556,"lon":138.62638889,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Gthumb.svg/500px-Gthumb.svg.png?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":480},"pageimage":"Gthumb.svg","extract":"国立療養所栗生楽泉園（こくりつりょうようじょくりうらくせんえん）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町に位置する国立ハンセン病療養所。厚生労働省所管の施設等機関である。"},"836756":{"pageid":836756,"ns":0,"title":"草津温泉バスターミナル","index":21,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.62083333,"lon":138.59644444,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/251128_Kusatsu_Onsen_Bus_Terminal_01.jpg/500px-251128_Kusatsu_Onsen_Bus_Terminal_01.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":270},"pageimage":"251128_Kusatsu_Onsen_Bus_Terminal_01.jpg","extract":"草津温泉バスターミナル（くさつおんせんバスターミナル）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町にあるバスターミナルである。施設管理は草津観光公社が行っている。"},"862627":{"pageid":862627,"ns":0,"title":"光泉寺","index":22,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.62227778,"lon":138.59505556,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Kosen-ji_%28Kusatsu%29_Main_Hall.JPG/500px-Kosen-ji_%28Kusatsu%29_Main_Hall.JPG?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"Kosen-ji_(Kusatsu)_Main_Hall.JPG","extract":"光泉寺（こうせんじ）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町にある真言宗豊山派の寺院である。山号は草津山。"},"885735":{"pageid":885735,"ns":0,"title":"草津町立草津中学校","index":23,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.62025,"lon":138.5905,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"extract":"草津町立草津中学校（くさつちょうりつ くさつちゅうがっこう）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町にある町立中学校。"},"1012218":{"pageid":1012218,"ns":0,"title":"草津温泉スキー場","index":24,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.62916667,"lon":138.58583333,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"extract":"草津温泉スキー場（くさつおんせんスキーじょう）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町に位置するスキー場。\n施設は草津町が保有し、指定管理者制度に基づき管理・運営は草津町が90%近くを出資する株式会社草津観光公社が行っている。"},"1073425":{"pageid":1073425,"ns":0,"title":"万座温泉スキー場","index":25,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.63611111,"lon":138.50555556,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Manza-prince.jpg/500px-Manza-prince.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":270},"pageimage":"Manza-prince.jpg","extract":"万座温泉スキー場（まんざおんせんスキーじょう）は、群馬県吾妻郡嬬恋村に位置するスキー場。"},"1101346":{"pageid":1101346,"ns":0,"title":"草津シズカ山スキー場","index":26,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.60694444,"lon":138.56833333,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/SKI_PORT_SIZCA.jpg/500px-SKI_PORT_SIZCA.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":225},"pageimage":"SKI_PORT_SIZCA.jpg","extract":"草津シズカ山スキー場（くさつシズカやまスキーじょう）は、かつて群馬県吾妻郡草津町に存在していたスキー場。"},"1112053":{"pageid":1112053,"ns":0,"title":"横手山","index":27,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.66888889,"lon":138.52583333,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Yokoteyama_from_Maeyama01n3200.jpg/500px-Yokoteyama_from_Maeyama01n3200.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"Yokoteyama_from_Maeyama01n3200.jpg","extract":"横手山（よこてやま）は、長野県下高井郡山ノ内町と群馬県吾妻郡中之条町との境にある火山である。"},"1259542":{"pageid":1259542,"ns":0,"title":"群馬鉄山","index":28,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.65308333,"lon":138.59708333,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/%E7%A9%B4%E5%9C%B0%E7%8D%84_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-%E7%A9%B4%E5%9C%B0%E7%8D%84_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"穴地獄_-_panoramio.jpg","extract":"群馬鉄山（ぐんまてつざん）は、群馬県吾妻郡六合村（現・中之条町）に存在した鉱山。群馬鉱山とも呼ばれる。"},"1574256":{"pageid":1574256,"ns":0,"title":"万座プリンスホテル","index":29,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.63705556,"lon":138.50758333,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Manza-prince-2019-06.jpg/500px-Manza-prince-2019-06.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":270},"pageimage":"Manza-prince-2019-06.jpg","extract":"万座プリンスホテル（まんざプリンスホテル）は、群馬県吾妻郡嬬恋村の万座温泉にあるホテル。西武・プリンスホテルズワールドワイドが運営しており、同社が運営する万座温泉スキー場に隣接している。"},"1929027":{"pageid":1929027,"ns":0,"title":"コンウォール・リー","index":30,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.622033,"lon":138.599703,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Kusatsu_Shotoku_Park_Cornwall_Legh_bust_monument.jpg/500px-Kusatsu_Shotoku_Park_Cornwall_Legh_bust_monument.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":361},"pageimage":"Kusatsu_Shotoku_Park_Cornwall_Legh_bust_monument.jpg","extract":"コンウォール・リー（Mary Helena Cornwall Legh、1857年5月20日-1941年12月18日）は、英国女性。宣教師の道を歩み1907年来日。"},"2007577":{"pageid":2007577,"ns":0,"title":"草津熱帯圏","index":31,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.62261111,"lon":138.60472222,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Kusatsu_Nettaiken.JPG/500px-Kusatsu_Nettaiken.JPG?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"Kusatsu_Nettaiken.JPG","extract":"草津熱帯圏（くさつねったいけん）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町に所在する動物園。日本の動物園としては最も高い場所に位置し、飼育する爬虫類の種類及び飼育数は関東地方の動物園としては日本一である。"},"2046442":{"pageid":2046442,"ns":0,"title":"本白根山","index":32,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.622939,"lon":138.531667,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Mt.Kusatsu-Shirane.JPG/500px-Mt.Kusatsu-Shirane.JPG?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"Mt.Kusatsu-Shirane.JPG","extract":"本白根山（もとしらねさん）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町と嬬恋村にまたがる標高2,171mの火山。本白根火砕丘、鏡池火砕丘、鏡池北火砕丘などからなる火砕丘群である。"},"2079481":{"pageid":2079481,"ns":0,"title":"暮坂峠","index":33,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.602222,"lon":138.684167,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Kuresaka_Pass_summit_Wakayama_Bokusui_monument.jpg/500px-Kuresaka_Pass_summit_Wakayama_Bokusui_monument.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"Kuresaka_Pass_summit_Wakayama_Bokusui_monument.jpg","extract":"暮坂峠（くれさかとうげ）は、群馬県吾妻郡中之条町にある峠。\n\n群馬県道55号中之条草津線上にあり、かつては六合村と中之条町の町村境であった（現在は当該町村同士が合併）。"},"2082892":{"pageid":2082892,"ns":0,"title":"万座峠","index":34,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.64,"lon":138.49,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Japan_Joshinetsu_topographic_map.webp/500px-Japan_Joshinetsu_topographic_map.webp?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":480},"pageimage":"Japan_Joshinetsu_topographic_map.webp","extract":"万座峠（まんざとうげ）は、群馬県吾妻郡嬬恋村と長野県上高井郡高山村との境にある峠である。\n万座山と黒湯山の鞍部にあり、長野県道・群馬県道466号牧干俣線（上信スカイライン）が通る。"},"2492142":{"pageid":2492142,"ns":0,"title":"太子駅","index":35,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.58638889,"lon":138.62458333,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Oshi_Station_2017-08_2.jpg/500px-Oshi_Station_2017-08_2.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"Oshi_Station_2017-08_2.jpg","extract":"太子駅（おおしえき）は、かつて群馬県吾妻郡六合村（現在の中之条町）大字太子にあった日本国有鉄道（国鉄）吾妻線（太子支線）の駅（廃駅）である。"},"3066139":{"pageid":3066139,"ns":0,"title":"白根火山ロープウェイ","index":36,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.62980556,"lon":138.55066667,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"extract":"白根火山ロープウェイ（しらねかざんロープウェイ）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町にかつて存在した草津観光公社のロープウェイである。白根火山ゴンドラとも呼ばれた。"},"3229605":{"pageid":3229605,"ns":0,"title":"妙高戸隠連山国立公園","index":37,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.625,"lon":138.625,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Lake_Nojiri.JPG/500px-Lake_Nojiri.JPG?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"Lake_Nojiri.JPG","extract":"妙高戸隠連山国立公園（みょうこうとがくしれんざんこくりつこうえん）は、新潟県と長野県にまたがる国立公園である。2015年に上信越高原国立公園から分離して成立した、比較的新しい国立公園である。"},"3627429":{"pageid":3627429,"ns":0,"title":"常布の滝","index":38,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.645,"lon":138.56355556,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Jofu-no-taki.jpg/500px-Jofu-no-taki.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":720},"pageimage":"Jofu-no-taki.jpg","extract":"常布の滝（じょうふのたき）は、群馬県草津町草津の大沢川にある滝。日本の滝百選の一つに選ばれている。"},"3878267":{"pageid":3878267,"ns":0,"title":"草津町立温泉図書館","index":39,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.62080556,"lon":138.59647222,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Kusatsu-Onsen-Sta-Outside.jpg/500px-Kusatsu-Onsen-Sta-Outside.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"Kusatsu-Onsen-Sta-Outside.jpg","extract":"草津町立温泉図書館（くさつちょうりつおんせんとしょかん）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町草津にある公立図書館。温泉地にある図書館として住民だけでなく観光客の利用も多い。"},"4208497":{"pageid":4208497,"ns":0,"title":"応徳温泉","index":40,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.60753,"lon":138.63908,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Japan_Joshinetsu_topographic_map.webp/500px-Japan_Joshinetsu_topographic_map.webp?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":480},"pageimage":"Japan_Joshinetsu_topographic_map.webp","extract":"応徳温泉（おうとくおんせん）は、群馬県吾妻郡中之条町にある温泉。尻焼温泉、花敷温泉、京塚温泉と共に六合温泉郷を形成する。"},"4250815":{"pageid":4250815,"ns":0,"title":"中之条町立六合小学校","index":41,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.59699444,"lon":138.6272,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Kuni_elementary_school.jpg/500px-Kuni_elementary_school.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"Kuni_elementary_school.jpg","extract":"中之条町立六合小学校（なかのじょうちょうりつ くにしょうがっこう）は、群馬県吾妻郡中之条町の旧六合村域にある公立小学校。"},"4302152":{"pageid":4302152,"ns":0,"title":"渋峠ホテル","index":42,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.66616667,"lon":138.53408333,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Shibu-toge02n4272.jpg/500px-Shibu-toge02n4272.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":320},"pageimage":"Shibu-toge02n4272.jpg","extract":"渋峠ホテル（しぶとうげホテル）は、長野県下高井郡山ノ内町と群馬県吾妻郡中之条町の境にある渋峠に位置するホテルである。"},"4511459":{"pageid":4511459,"ns":0,"title":"横手山・渋峠スキー場","index":43,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.67277778,"lon":138.51888889,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Yokoteyama_Ski_Area.jpg/500px-Yokoteyama_Ski_Area.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":236},"pageimage":"Yokoteyama_Ski_Area.jpg","extract":"横手山・渋峠スキー場（よこてやま・しぶとうげスキーじょう）は、長野県下高井郡山ノ内町および群馬県吾妻郡中之条町に跨り存在するスキー場である。"},"4622659":{"pageid":4622659,"ns":0,"title":"羽根尾城","index":44,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.55405556,"lon":138.60741667,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Map_of_Gunma_Prefecture_Ja.svg/500px-Map_of_Gunma_Prefecture_Ja.svg.png?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":501},"pageimage":"Map_of_Gunma_Prefecture_Ja.svg","extract":"羽根尾城（はねおじょう）は、群馬県吾妻郡長野原町（上野国吾妻郡羽根尾）にあった日本の城。かつては国衆・羽尾氏の本拠であり、後に武田氏・真田氏の持城となった。"},"4626491":{"pageid":4626491,"ns":0,"title":"長野原城","index":45,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.55375,"lon":138.64088889,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Map_of_Gunma_Prefecture_Ja.svg/500px-Map_of_Gunma_Prefecture_Ja.svg.png?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":501},"pageimage":"Map_of_Gunma_Prefecture_Ja.svg","extract":"長野原城（ながのはらじょう）は、群馬県吾妻郡長野原町（上野国吾妻郡長野原）にあった日本の城。別名箱岩城。"},"4628410":{"pageid":4628410,"ns":0,"title":"スーパー大津","index":46,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.55383333,"lon":138.61561111,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Naganohara_Shopping_Park_Lex%27s.jpg/500px-Naganohara_Shopping_Park_Lex%27s.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":270},"pageimage":"Naganohara_Shopping_Park_Lex's.jpg","extract":"スーパー大津（スーパーおおつ）は、群馬県のスーパーマーケット。群馬県吾妻郡長野原町大字大津に所在する株式会社田村商店（たむらしょうてん）が運営している。"},"5128405":{"pageid":5128405,"ns":0,"title":"白根神社 (草津町)","index":47,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.62466667,"lon":138.59625,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Shirane_Shrine_in_Kusatsu_town.jpg/500px-Shirane_Shrine_in_Kusatsu_town.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":360},"pageimage":"Shirane_Shrine_in_Kusatsu_town.jpg","extract":"白根神社（しらねじんじゃ）は、群馬県吾妻郡草津町に所在する神社。草津温泉で知られる草津町の総鎮守。"},"5262857":{"pageid":5262857,"ns":0,"title":"六合郵便局","index":48,"coordinates":[{"lat":36.59550278,"lon":138.6273,"primary":"","globe":"earth"}],"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Gthumb.svg/500px-Gthumb.svg.png?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":480,"height":480},"pageimage":"Gthumb.svg","extract":"六合郵便局（くにゆうびんきょく）は群馬県吾妻郡中之条町小雨にある郵便局である。民営化前の分類では無集配特定郵便局であった。"}}}}}